cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived tables, please cite both the article and this repository (version v1.0.0; integrity verifiable via MANIFEST.sha256)."
title: "Conserved nerve-injury-associated transcriptional response on the dorsal root ganglion–spinal axis: non-predictive incision translation and an honest repurposing null"
abstract: >-
  Computational study integrating public transcriptomic datasets across the DRG-spinal-cord axis:
  cross-dataset meta-analysis, dual-machine-learning hub-gene prioritisation, single-cell
  localisation, and structure-based virtual screening of the approved-drug library (ChEMBL
  max_phase = 4) against ten tractable hub targets, with an explicit control-based validation
  framework (docking-parameter fidelity, independently labelled enrichment, molecular-weight
  confounder control, and a reportable face-validity test).
type: software
